{ t => 'The ambush test', p => 'Your dashboard demo tomorrow will show a metric sourced from Daniel B\'s pipeline — with a change you made to its logic. Does he need a heads-up?', a => q{Yes — and the test explains it: learning his pipeline\'s behaviour changed from a meeting would feel like an ambush. One line tonight: "Tomorrow\'s demo shows the pipeline metric with my adjusted logic — flagging before you see it live." Thirty seconds, no-surprise courtesy delivered.} },
{ t => 'Route three questions', p => 'Route these using your map: (a) a scope change to your analysis, (b) a policy question on data retention, (c) budget approval for a new tool.', a => q{(a) Elena decides, Priya informed — scope touches architecture; (b) Elena, written, before noon; (c) Sarah or her manager — never delivery. If your answers differ from these, your map disagrees with the org — which is worth one clarifying coffee.} },
],
